WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.580 --> 00:00:02.800
Hi, Mystery Recapped here.

00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:09.840
Today I am going to explain the American post-apocalyptic
action film called “After Earth.”

00:00:09.840 --> 00:00:11.299
Spoilers ahead!

00:00:11.299 --> 00:00:16.900
Watch out and take care!

00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:22.199
The premise of the movie is set far in the
future when the earth has become uninhabitable.

00:00:22.199 --> 00:00:24.890
Humans have to find another planet to settle
upon.

00:00:24.890 --> 00:00:28.689
That is when the organization called the United
Ranger Corps is founded.

00:00:28.689 --> 00:00:33.980
The United Ranger Corps is a global military
effort in the evacuation of the earth.

00:00:33.980 --> 00:00:38.670
The rangers lead the settlement of mankind's
new home called Nova Prime.

00:00:38.670 --> 00:00:44.530
The exodus ends when humanity settles on a
new pristine planet they call Nova Prime.

00:00:44.530 --> 00:00:48.160
The only problem is that the planet already
has beings living on it.

00:00:48.160 --> 00:00:53.430
The natives of Nova prime release monstrous
creatures called the ursas to get rid of the

00:00:53.430 --> 00:00:54.800
human settlers.

00:00:54.800 --> 00:00:59.730
The ursas are technically blind but they can
detect humans by sensing the pheromones that

00:00:59.730 --> 00:01:02.350
the human brain releases when they are scared.

00:01:02.350 --> 00:01:06.770
The creatures can literally smell fear in
humans and attack.

00:01:06.770 --> 00:01:10.300
Because of them, humankind is again in danger
of extinction.

00:01:10.300 --> 00:01:14.890
One thousand years later, the rangers who
had helped humans to evacuate the earth find

00:01:14.890 --> 00:01:17.000
a way to defeat the ursas.

00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:22.360
The prime commander Cypher Raige creates a
technique called ghosting where he can fearlessly

00:01:22.360 --> 00:01:26.530
battle with the ursas making himself practically
invisible to them.

00:01:26.530 --> 00:01:31.480
Using this technique, the rangers defeat the
ursas and live on Nova Prime peacefully.

00:01:31.480 --> 00:01:35.490
The scene cuts to some teenagers training
to become rangers in the human settlement

00:01:35.490 --> 00:01:36.860
of prime nova.

00:01:36.860 --> 00:01:40.380
One of the ambitious teens is commander Cypher’s
son Kitai.

00:01:40.380 --> 00:01:45.770
Kitai’s elder sister Senshi was killed while
trying to save him from an ursa so he trains

00:01:45.770 --> 00:01:49.490
hard every day to become a ranger and fight
them.

00:01:49.490 --> 00:01:55.060
On the evaluation day, the evaluator, Commander
tells Kitai that his test scores are impressive

00:01:55.060 --> 00:01:57.510
but his field activity is average.

00:01:57.510 --> 00:02:00.070
Hence, he is not selected as a ranger.

00:02:00.070 --> 00:02:03.540
Kitai retaliates but Commander dismisses the
conversation.

00:02:03.540 --> 00:02:08.340
In the following scene, we see the prime commander
Cypher finally arrive home after his expedition

00:02:08.340 --> 00:02:09.550
to another planet.

00:02:09.550 --> 00:02:12.200
He meets his wife Faia and greets her.

00:02:12.200 --> 00:02:16.530
At night the family is having dinner when
Cypher asks Kitai about his training.

00:02:16.530 --> 00:02:21.500
Kitai replies he hasn’t been selected and
Cypher simply asks him to try harder.

00:02:21.500 --> 00:02:25.970
Kitai rudely gets up from the table making
Cypher yell at him to sit back down.

00:02:25.970 --> 00:02:30.760
After dinner, Cypher tells Faia that he is
leaving for his last voyage to Iphitos to

00:02:30.760 --> 00:02:32.080
train some rangers.

00:02:32.080 --> 00:02:34.500
He plans to retire after the trip.

00:02:34.500 --> 00:02:38.140
Faia asks him to take Kitai with him so he
could learn how to be a ranger.

00:02:38.140 --> 00:02:43.590
She vaguely reveals that Kitai blames himself
for his elder sister Senshi’s death.

00:02:43.590 --> 00:02:47.680
The following day, Cypher and Kitai prepare
to leave for the expedition.

00:02:47.680 --> 00:02:52.690
Before they leave, Cypher is approached by
a ranger who has lost one of his legs in battle.

00:02:52.690 --> 00:02:57.319
The ranger thanks Cypher for saving his life
and gets on his foot to salute him.

00:02:57.319 --> 00:03:01.640
Kitai watches the commotion in fascination,
admiring how the other rangers respect his

00:03:01.640 --> 00:03:02.640
father.

00:03:02.640 --> 00:03:07.030
The rangers are also lifting a captured ursa
in their ship to use in training.

00:03:07.030 --> 00:03:09.960
Everyone boards the spaceship and it finally
takes off.

00:03:09.960 --> 00:03:15.230
Halfway in their trip, Cypher asks Kitai to
strap in and take a rest like the others.

00:03:15.230 --> 00:03:18.520
But because of the uncomfortable seat, he
doesn’t fall asleep.

00:03:18.520 --> 00:03:21.780
So, goes to a restricted area where the ursa
is kept.

00:03:21.780 --> 00:03:25.010
He is then stopped by a ranger who makes fun
of him for being intrusive.

00:03:25.010 --> 00:03:29.989
A group of rangers allows him to go near the
restrained ursa to see if he is fearless like

00:03:29.989 --> 00:03:30.989
his father.

00:03:30.989 --> 00:03:34.740
But the ursa smells Kitai’s fear and growls.

00:03:34.740 --> 00:03:39.599
Just then, Cypher wakes up and checks the
gravitational force in the ship using a technology

00:03:39.599 --> 00:03:40.870
fitted in his ring.

00:03:40.870 --> 00:03:44.790
He notices something is off and orders the
rangers to secure all cargo.

00:03:44.790 --> 00:03:47.620
Kitai goes back to his seat and straps himself
in.

00:03:47.620 --> 00:03:51.069
Cypher then asks the pilot about the nearest
asteroid shower.

00:03:51.069 --> 00:03:55.730
At first, the pilots do not detect one but
as time passes by they notice a heavy asteroid

00:03:55.730 --> 00:03:57.430
shower coming their way.

00:03:57.430 --> 00:04:01.989
It hits the ship making it shake aggressively
and causing some serious damage to it.

00:04:01.989 --> 00:04:05.610
The rangers start to panic and the only one
strapped in is Kitai.

00:04:05.610 --> 00:04:08.420
He hyperventilates, scared of what is about
to happen.

00:04:08.420 --> 00:04:12.530
Cypher orders the pilots to travel to the
wormhole and they finally reach outside the

00:04:12.530 --> 00:04:13.680
asteroid shower.

00:04:13.680 --> 00:04:18.779
However, the ship is heavily damaged and cannot
go on for a long time, so they will have to

00:04:18.779 --> 00:04:21.530
land on the nearest planet suitable for humans.

00:04:21.530 --> 00:04:24.589
While searching for such a planet, the pilot
comes across the earth.

00:04:24.589 --> 00:04:29.499
Cypher is skeptical about landing on their
old home because the earth has become a class-1

00:04:29.499 --> 00:04:34.139
quarantined planet after humans’ departure
but has no other way out.

00:04:34.139 --> 00:04:38.340
As the ship falls on the earth’s surface
at an uncontrollable speed, Cypher approaches

00:04:38.340 --> 00:04:40.309
his son and calms him down.

00:04:40.309 --> 00:04:45.580
Kitai gets visions of the time they were attacked
by an ursa and his sister Senshi was killed.

00:04:45.580 --> 00:04:50.009
Just then, the ship starts to break causing
everyone around Kitai to fall off it.

00:04:50.009 --> 00:04:55.270
At last, Kitai falls unconscious and crashlands
on the surface of the earth.

00:04:55.270 --> 00:04:59.110
Humans have returned to earth after a thousand
years.

00:04:59.110 --> 00:05:04.159
After a while, he wakes up and looks around
to find the dead bodies of fellow rangers.

00:05:04.159 --> 00:05:08.580
He also sees his father lying limp on the
ground and hugs him.

00:05:08.580 --> 00:05:12.569
To Kitai’s surprise, Cypher gains consciousness
and greets him.

00:05:12.569 --> 00:05:17.270
But both of his legs are severely injured
making it impossible for him to stand up.

00:05:17.270 --> 00:05:21.409
Cypher asks him how many people survived,
only to find out that everyone except for

00:05:21.409 --> 00:05:22.949
them is dead.

00:05:22.949 --> 00:05:27.349
Moreover, the rear part of the ship is absent
meaning that the captured ursa has landed

00:05:27.349 --> 00:05:28.400
somewhere else.

00:05:28.400 --> 00:05:32.619
Cypher believes that the creature might be
dead from the impact but still asks Kitai

00:05:32.619 --> 00:05:33.619
to be careful.

00:05:33.619 --> 00:05:38.159
Cypher makes Kitai get an emergency beacon
that can be used to send signals to a rescue

00:05:38.159 --> 00:05:39.639
group in prime nova.

00:05:39.639 --> 00:05:42.839
But they are disappointed to see that the
beacon is fully damaged.

00:05:42.839 --> 00:05:46.809
Then, Kitai takes Cypher to the control panel
which is still working.

00:05:46.809 --> 00:05:51.759
From there, Cypher finds out the location
of the second beacon that is in the tail section

00:05:51.759 --> 00:05:52.759
of the ship.

00:05:52.759 --> 00:05:56.869
A hologram shows that the second beacon has
landed a hundred kilometers away from their

00:05:56.869 --> 00:05:57.869
current location.

00:05:57.869 --> 00:06:01.869
Without the beacon, they will never be able
to get back home, so they will have to retrieve

00:06:01.869 --> 00:06:02.869
it.

00:06:02.869 --> 00:06:06.499
But since Cypher is not in a condition to
walk, Kitai will have to do it himself.

00:06:06.499 --> 00:06:10.789
Cypher warns him about the creatures of the
earth who have evolved to kill humans in the

00:06:10.789 --> 00:06:12.259
past thousand years.

00:06:12.259 --> 00:06:16.740
The journey will not be easy for Kitai but
Cypher will be watching him and his trails

00:06:16.740 --> 00:06:18.979
from the control panel at all times.

00:06:18.979 --> 00:06:24.349
Cypher gives Kitai his weapon, a wrist communicator,
and six capsules of a fluid that enhances

00:06:24.349 --> 00:06:28.589
the oxygen intake so he can breathe in Earth's
low-oxygen atmosphere.

00:06:28.589 --> 00:06:33.129
He asks Kitai to take the capsules in regular
intervals and sets him off for his journey.

00:06:33.129 --> 00:06:37.279
Starting his journey, Kitai climbs a sloppy
hill and reaches the top.

00:06:37.279 --> 00:06:41.189
There, he is fascinated to see several lives
on the earth.

00:06:41.189 --> 00:06:45.759
The earth now has violent thermal shifts because
of which the nights are too cold to handle.

00:06:45.759 --> 00:06:50.929
Hence, Cypher advises Kitai to reach the “hot
spots” caused by the geothermal energy every

00:06:50.929 --> 00:06:53.050
night to keep himself warm.

00:06:53.050 --> 00:06:57.930
After that, Cypher checks the condition of
his legs and sees that they are severely damaged.

00:06:57.930 --> 00:07:03.060
He takes a painkiller for the moment which
makes him go hazy.

00:07:03.060 --> 00:07:12.059
By midday, Kitai reaches a forest when Cypher
notices a creature approaching him from the

00:07:12.059 --> 00:07:13.059
monitor.

00:07:13.059 --> 00:07:16.270
He informs Kitai of the creature and asks
him to stay put.

00:07:16.270 --> 00:07:20.919
The animal turns out to be an evolved violent
monkey.

00:07:20.919 --> 00:07:25.689
Kitai gets scared and throws a rock at the
animal, attracting a group of monkeys who

00:07:25.689 --> 00:07:26.689
chase him.

00:07:26.689 --> 00:07:30.909
A worried Cypher gives him the directions
as Kitai runs for his life.

00:07:30.909 --> 00:07:33.749
The monkeys leave him after he jumps into
a river.

00:07:33.749 --> 00:07:37.539
Kitai finally stops running and finds a poisonous
leech stuck to him.

00:07:37.539 --> 00:07:41.589
He hurriedly removes the parasite but the
creature has already left its venom in his

00:07:41.589 --> 00:07:42.589
body.

00:07:42.589 --> 00:07:45.789
Kitai starts to lose his vision and his body
stops moving.

00:07:45.789 --> 00:07:48.749
Cypher orders him to get an antidote from
his medical kit.

00:07:48.749 --> 00:07:52.429
Kitai injects the dose and falls unconscious
right after.

00:07:52.429 --> 00:07:56.710
After a while, Cypher wakes Kitai up saying
that the temperature is dropping rapidly as

00:07:56.710 --> 00:07:57.990
night approaches.

00:07:57.990 --> 00:08:02.270
He will have to get to a hot spot quickly
if he doesn’t want to freeze to death.

00:08:02.270 --> 00:08:07.020
Kitai wakes up, completely healed from the
leach’s poison, and makes his way forward.

00:08:07.020 --> 00:08:11.899
Meanwhile, Cypher performs a make-do surgery
on his legs to make them better but he knows

00:08:11.899 --> 00:08:13.990
that he doesn’t have much time left.

00:08:13.990 --> 00:08:18.189
At that moment, he reminisces about the time
he wished his daughter a happy birthday before

00:08:18.189 --> 00:08:19.189
her death.

00:08:19.189 --> 00:08:22.659
A while later, Kitai finally arrives at the
first hotspot.

00:08:22.659 --> 00:08:26.689
He checks his equipment for the day and sees
that two capsules of liquid that enhance his

00:08:26.689 --> 00:08:28.939
oxygen level are destroyed.

00:08:28.939 --> 00:08:31.879
This means that he will have to reach his
destination sooner.

00:08:31.879 --> 00:08:35.810
Knowing that Cypher will ask him to return
if he finds out about the broken vials, Kitai

00:08:35.810 --> 00:08:41.270
lies saying everything is intact.

00:08:41.270 --> 00:08:46.050
At night, Kitai asks Cypher how he discovered
the ghosting technique for the first time.

00:08:46.050 --> 00:08:50.080
Cypher tells him that he was going on a run
when an ursa appeared right in front of him.

00:08:50.080 --> 00:08:55.450
A scared Cypher froze and the ursa shot its
pincer right through Cypher’s shoulder making

00:08:55.450 --> 00:08:58.340
the both of them fall into a river off the
cliff.

00:08:58.340 --> 00:09:02.890
At the bottom of the river, the ursa remained
on top of Cypher trying to drown him.

00:09:02.890 --> 00:09:06.950
At that moment, Cypher accepted his death
and wasn’t scared anymore.

00:09:06.950 --> 00:09:15.590
Because of this, the ursa couldn’t see him
and he was able to kill it.

00:09:15.590 --> 00:09:17.960
Kitai falls asleep listening to the story.

00:09:17.960 --> 00:09:20.370
The following day, he continues his journey.

00:09:20.370 --> 00:09:24.390
Halfway through the day, Cypher starts to
notice hints of the presence of ursa in the

00:09:24.390 --> 00:09:25.390
area.

00:09:25.390 --> 00:09:29.450
Kitai reaches a tall waterfall which he will
have to cross to reach the destination.

00:09:29.450 --> 00:09:33.450
Cypher asks him to check his supplies and
is disappointed to see that he has only two

00:09:33.450 --> 00:09:35.320
vials of liquid oxygen left.

00:09:35.320 --> 00:09:40.130
An embarrassed Kitai says he can make it to
the tail with just two but Cypher asks him

00:09:40.130 --> 00:09:41.680
to abort the mission.

00:09:41.680 --> 00:09:45.390
Right then, Kitai gets a flashback of the
day his sister Senshi died.

00:09:45.390 --> 00:09:50.450
An ursa had attacked their home and like always,
Cypher was on a mission somewhere else.

00:09:50.450 --> 00:09:54.950
To save her brother’s life, Senshi had kept
him inside a glass sphere from where the ursa

00:09:54.950 --> 00:09:56.760
couldn’t smell his fear.

00:09:56.760 --> 00:10:01.360
That day, Kitai witnessed his sister getting
killed in front of him and to this date, he

00:10:01.360 --> 00:10:03.110
blames himself for it.

00:10:03.110 --> 00:10:07.280
Back in the present, Kitai argues with Cypher
claiming that he is not a coward.

00:10:07.280 --> 00:10:12.500
Cypher tries to calm him but in the moment
of rage, Kitai jumps off the cliff.

00:10:12.500 --> 00:10:15.680
He uses his suit to guide the direction of
his fall.

00:10:15.680 --> 00:10:19.530
Just when he thinks that he can make it to
the bottom, a large bird attacks him and breaks

00:10:19.530 --> 00:10:20.530
his communicator.

00:10:20.530 --> 00:10:23.490
Now, Cypher has no way to contact Kitai.

00:10:23.490 --> 00:10:28.160
A while later, Kitai wakes up in the bird’s
nest surrounded by its chicks.

00:10:28.160 --> 00:10:31.910
Before he can get out, all of them are attacked
by a group of panthers.

00:10:31.910 --> 00:10:36.750
The mother bird fights the one on the top
of the nest while Kitai fights a panther inside

00:10:36.750 --> 00:10:37.750
it.

00:10:37.750 --> 00:10:40.650
By the end of the fight, all of the bird’s
chicks are dead.

00:10:40.650 --> 00:10:46.690
As it tries to revive them in frustration,
Kitai runs away from the place.

00:10:46.690 --> 00:10:50.960
Meanwhile, Cypher tries to look for Kitai
through his satellite monitors but instead

00:10:50.960 --> 00:10:53.660
finds two rangers impaled to a tree.

00:10:53.660 --> 00:10:56.400
The system detects the presence of an ursa
in the area.

00:10:56.400 --> 00:11:00.320
Unknown to this, Kitai takes rest in a cave
for the night.

00:11:00.320 --> 00:11:04.200
Without his father navigating the way, he
has to rely on his memory to reach the tail

00:11:04.200 --> 00:11:05.210
of the ship.

00:11:05.210 --> 00:11:12.380
He draws a map on the wall and decides to
follow it.

00:11:12.380 --> 00:11:16.460
The next morning, he continues the journey
but is troubled by the same bird following

00:11:16.460 --> 00:11:17.640
him everywhere.

00:11:17.640 --> 00:11:22.100
At midday, he has a hard time breathing so
he takes his last vial of oxygen.

00:11:22.100 --> 00:11:27.480
Then, to reach the tail sooner, he builds
a raft from logs and continues his journey.

00:11:27.480 --> 00:11:32.050
After some time, Kitai falls asleep and dreams
of his sister telling him he is close to the

00:11:32.050 --> 00:11:33.050
destination.

00:11:33.050 --> 00:11:37.900
He wakes up right before the temperature fluctuation
starts and goes around looking for a hotspot.

00:11:37.900 --> 00:11:41.300
However, without Cypher’s help, he is unable
to find one.

00:11:41.300 --> 00:11:45.190
The temperature drops extremely low and everything
around him freezes.

00:11:45.190 --> 00:11:50.420
Soon, Kitai drops unconscious on the ground
and we see something drag him to a warm safe

00:11:50.420 --> 00:11:51.420
corner.

00:11:51.420 --> 00:11:54.790
Kitai wakes up the following morning to see
that the bird has saved his life.

00:11:54.790 --> 00:11:58.490
It had covered him with leaves and twigs,
treating him as his chicks.

00:11:58.490 --> 00:12:03.070
Kitai thanks the bird but notices it is already
dead.

00:12:03.070 --> 00:12:09.050
However, with no time to waste, he moves forward
and finally finds the tail of the ship.

00:12:09.050 --> 00:12:14.110
He finds a vial of liquid oxygen and quickly
takes it which rejuvenates him to some extent.

00:12:14.110 --> 00:12:18.080
Then, he sees that the ursa is missing from
where it is supposed to be.

00:12:18.080 --> 00:12:22.620
Kitai gets the beacon and contacts Cypher
using the panel in the tail.

00:12:22.620 --> 00:12:28.680
Cypher, who is only somewhat conscious, is
delighted to see his son alive.

00:12:28.680 --> 00:12:32.550
However, Kitai cannot hear him because of
some technical issue.

00:12:32.550 --> 00:12:36.910
Kitai then tries using the beacon but it doesn’t
work due to atmospheric interference.

00:12:36.910 --> 00:12:41.750
Cypher asks him to try from a different location
but since Kitai cannot hear him, he only gets

00:12:41.750 --> 00:12:43.080
more frustrated.

00:12:43.080 --> 00:12:47.780
But after a while, Kitai sees a volcano nearby
and decides to try using the beacon from the

00:12:47.780 --> 00:12:48.840
top of it.

00:12:48.840 --> 00:12:53.800
However, trouble soon follows when the lost
ursa tracks Kitai and senses his fear.

00:12:53.800 --> 00:12:57.140
Cypher sees this from the monitor and is worried
for him.

00:12:57.140 --> 00:13:01.780
Kitai, on the other hand, finds out that the
creature is following him and starts to run.

00:13:01.780 --> 00:13:06.820
The ursa attacks Kitai but he manages to save
himself after jumping into a waterbody and

00:13:06.820 --> 00:13:08.580
going up the mountain.

00:13:08.580 --> 00:13:13.130
Just then, the temperature starts to lower
which freezes Kitai, making him fall to the

00:13:13.130 --> 00:13:14.130
ground.

00:13:14.130 --> 00:13:17.840
At the same time, Cypher also falls unconscious
because of his injuries.

00:13:17.840 --> 00:13:21.540
The ursa approaches Kitai as he thinks of
his father’s words.

00:13:21.540 --> 00:13:27.510
He remembers that fear is not real and it’s
all only in his head.

00:13:27.510 --> 00:13:31.780
Just then, the creature walks right past Kitai,
unable to detect him.

00:13:31.780 --> 00:13:39.880
He has removed fear from his mind and is now
able to ghost the creature.

00:13:39.880 --> 00:13:43.920
Using his newfound courage, Kitai kills the
creature easily.

00:13:43.920 --> 00:13:47.080
He then uses the beacon to send signals to
their rescue team.

00:13:47.080 --> 00:13:49.700
In the next scene, Kitai is on a rescue ship.

00:13:49.700 --> 00:13:52.940
He walks forwards as everyone watches him
in appreciation.

00:13:52.940 --> 00:13:56.380
Cypher lies on a bed being treated for his
injuries.

00:13:56.380 --> 00:14:01.500
After seeing his son, he makes the rangers
stand him up and salutes Kitai in a true ranger

00:14:01.500 --> 00:14:02.500
fashion.

00:14:02.500 --> 00:14:08.170
The movie ends after the father and the son
hug and the ship takes off for nova prime.

00:14:08.170 --> 00:14:12.480
Subscribe for more videos like this, turn
on the notification, and leave a like to help

00:14:12.480 --> 00:14:13.720
the channel out.

00:14:13.720 --> 00:14:14.860
Thanks for watching.

